    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin adds a &#8220;Summarize with AI&#8221; button to your posts.</p>\n<p>When clicked, it sends the post content to AI.<br />\nThe button color, text, and prompt content can be changed from the Settings page.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Customize from Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> AI Summary Button.</li>\n<li>Add the shortcode <code>[mau_ai_summary_button]</code> to your text.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial public release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>mobile button style</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "The AI Summary Button allows you to easily send and summarize your posts to AI. The color, text, and prompt are customizable.",
